# gpu-box (192.168.1.142) :0 GNOME desktop over VNC -> always lands fullscreen on s2.
# Matched by title (NOT a blanket TigerVNC class match) so it never collides with the
# "agent sN" viewers above. Launcher waits for the VNC port and passes
# -FullscreenSystemKeys=0 so i3 keybindings ($mod+h etc.) work over the VNC.
for_window [class="TigerVNC Viewer" title="^supermicro:0"] move container to workspace $ws2s, floating disable, fullscreen enable
exec --no-startup-id ~/.config/i3/scripts/gpu-box-gnome-vnc.sh

# gmktec (gmktec.local / 192.168.1.161) :1 virtual 4K Xvnc -> fullscreen on s18.
